  CallerID: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 09cdebfe05ccaad41adda79be1ca9067, type: 2}
  Stages:
  - Text: Rise and shine, buddy. Looks like those plants are coming along nicely, though they won't be ready for harvest until later today.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: Let's set up another OG Kush plant. We've got the seed, now we just need a pot, suspension rack, grow light, and some soil.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: Head over to the hardware store to grab these supplies. It might also be a good idea to grab some <h1>Speed Grow</h> while you're at it.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
